-- Stat weights per role, as data. Source: GearQuest Forever (Henrik8210), as published in
-- Pawn Forever (turlockmike, MIT). These are community estimates, not measured from the game, so
-- Gear Advisor labels every score built from them as an estimate. Pawn counts crit, hit, haste and
-- dodge per 1%; they are divided by the rating per 1% Pawn Forever measured on Forever tooltips
-- (crit 14, hit 10, dodge 12; haste 10 is its estimate) to give a weight per rating point. Expertise,
-- defense, health, mana and resistances are left out: no verified conversion yet.
